== policy ask
manifest approval-policy order=300 owner=human.approval.prompt
Approval policy: ask. A tool call that needs approval waits until a person allows or rejects it. A call whose approval is rejected, cancelled or unavailable did not run.
== policy never
manifest approval-policy order=300 owner=human.approval.prompt
Approval policy: never. Nobody is asked to approve tool calls in this session: a call that needs approval is rejected without running, so prefer actions that need no approval.
